					<![CDATA[
						 <p>It's finally here! ✨✨</p> <p>If more authors start writing for this canon, I'll group my articles in a separate series to increase visibility to other works. Until then, enjoy!</p> <p>Special thanks go to <span class="printuser avatarhover"><a href="http://www.wikidot.com/user:info/zyn" ><img class="small" src="http://www.wikidot.com/avatar.php?userid=1404533&amp;amp;size=small&amp;amp;timestamp=1578363514" alt="Zyn" style="background-image:url(http://www.wikidot.com/userkarma.php?u=1404533)" /></a><a href="http://www.wikidot.com/user:info/zyn" >Zyn</a></span> and <span class="printuser avatarhover"><a href="http://www.wikidot.com/user:info/calibri-bold" ><img class="small" src="http://www.wikidot.com/avatar.php?userid=5045819&amp;amp;size=small&amp;amp;timestamp=1578363514" alt="Calibri Bold" style="background-image:url(http://www.wikidot.com/userkarma.php?u=5045819)" /></a><a href="http://www.wikidot.com/user:info/calibri-bold" >Calibri Bold</a></span> for critiquing this hub, <span class="printuser avatarhover"><a href="http://www.wikidot.com/user:info/loddite" ><img class="small" src="http://www.wikidot.com/avatar.php?userid=2838587&amp;amp;size=small&amp;amp;timestamp=1578363514" alt="loddite" style="background-image:url(http://www.wikidot.com/userkarma.php?u=2838587)" /></a><a href="http://www.wikidot.com/user:info/loddite" >loddite</a></span> for pitching in, and everyone else who's helped me with my articles over the past year.</p> <hr /> <p><strong>Edit:</strong> <span style="text-decoration: line-through;">I've temporarily removed the associated CSS theme to resolve some issues with it. That'll back up in a bit.</span> Replaced the theme with local CSS for minor style things. This canon doesn't really need a theme and I'm not qualified to make one. Still, it was fun and I learned a lot!</p> 
				 	]]>
